The JSON certificates in certificates/ were produced by an exact-arithmetic
pipeline written in Julia and are checked here by an independent Python
program that shares no code with that pipeline. The Lean 4 files under lean/
are a mechanical translation of those JSON certificates. They are not
hand-written proofs. The Julia code under julia/ is the heuristic search
that proposed the game; it is not the certifier.

